 170          /*******************************************************************************
 171          * Function Name: I2S_Stop
 172          ********************************************************************************
 173          *
 174          * Summary:
 175          *  Disables the I2S interface. The sck and ws outputs are set to 0. The Tx and
 176          *  Rx directions are disabled and their FIFOs are cleared.
 177          *
